Z||000013||fierosound||01-25-2001||09:26 PM||||Thanks guys.. The system is built for high volume sound quality, not for "bass and nothing else".  It only hits about 115-120db, but scored 162/200 in Sound Quality alone.  Overall best score I've gotten is 352/438 at an official IASCA "Sound-Off" (1st Place in category).  I also got "Best of Show" at that event.  See  <A HREF="http://www.iasca.com" TARGET=_blank>www.iasca.com</A>   Check for Pontiac Fiero under COOL INSTALLS for other systems.<P>Jerpro - go to the forum LINK in the message for everything you need to know is there.  There are also some other photos at my main website <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierosound" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/fierosound</A> <P>Also see this forum of a member following my install instructions<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003006.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/003006.html</A> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 01-25-2001).]||||reg||1
